# NETS holds INSTRUCTIONS AND CODE ONLY - never survey material. These rules are a safety
# net against committing reports, extracts or StoX outputs by accident. Do not loosen them.
# (The pre-commit hook also refuses these types when force-added.)

# --- Reports, extracts and outputs ---
*.pdf
*.txt
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.odt
*.ods
*.html
*.htm
*.zip

# --- Tabular and binary data (StoX outputs, evidence logs, databases) ---
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xml
*.rds
*.rda
*.RData
*.parquet
*.feather
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.db

# --- Figures (maps can reveal positions) ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.svg

# --- Workspace folders, if one is ever created here by mistake ---
workspace/
sources/
local/
context/
evidence/
outputs/
data/
private/
scratch/

# --- R / Quarto / OS cruft ---
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj
.quarto/
*_files/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
